"""Reviewed specs for the animated explainer reels. One entry per theme; build.py renders any of them.

Every spec: id (the theme, used for the four-week no-repeat check), template (xray | oneclick | pov), title, tt_title,
caption (ends with one question), hashtags (3 to 5, #dialedoffroad last), cover_s (seconds into the video for the cover),
plus the template's own keys (see the template module's docstring).

Copy rules are the same as the static posts (tools/README.md): never "AI", "exact", "exactly", "perfect", "free trial",
never an em dash; numbers are starting points riders refine on the bike, one change at a time, clicks counted out from fully closed.
Suspension claims must be ones a suspension tech would sign off on; when in doubt, leave it out.
"""

